{
  "id":"tx-pu-math-contest-v2-ch1-1.1-ex-07","subject":"math","l2":"函数极限与连续","l3_id":"math.calc.limit.compute","atom_id":"","book_id":"","ability_goal":"construct","item_form":"blank","difficulty":"hit","question":"已知定义在[0,4]上的函数 $f(x)=3^x$，先延拓至[-4,0]为偶函数，再延拓至全实数轴为8周期函数.","answer":"当 $x\\in[-4,0]$ 时 $f(x)=3^{-x}$." ,"ref_source":"textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2","techniques":["周期延拓","奇偶延拓"],"solution":{"steps":[{"id":"s1","text":"分析 由偶函数定义 $f(-x)=f(x)$ 得到负半轴表达式；再利用周期性覆盖全轴."},{"id":"s2","text":"当 $x\\in[-4,0]$ 时，$-x\\in[0,4]$."},{"id":"s3","text":"由偶性 $f(x)=f(-x)=3^{-x}$."},{"id":"s4","text":"所以 $f(x)=3^{-x}$ 于负半轴."},{"id":"s5","text":"在[-4,4]上拼接得到定义."},{"id":"s6","text":"对任意实数选取整数k使 $x-8k\\in[-4,4]$."},{"id":"s7","text":"周期延拓完成."}],"final_answer":"$f(x)=3^{-x}$ on $[-4,0]$，并以8为周期延拓.","techniques_used":["周期延拓","奇偶延拓"]},"cdps":[{"id":"c1","prompt":"外层/内层函数的定义域分段如何决定复合后的区间划分？","technique":"周期延拓","expected":"先按外层分段条件反解内层，得到自变量区间，再代入对应表达式。"},{"id":"c2","prompt":"最终显式表达式（或所求对象）的关键结构是什么？","technique":"奇偶延拓","expected":"$f(x)=3^{-x}$ on $[-4,0]$."}],"meta":{"source":"textbook_example","book_id":"puheping_math_contest_v2","book_title":"","book_author":"蒲和平","chapter":"","section":"1.1","example_id":"例7*","page":11,"quality_basis":"source_textbook_worked_example","starred":true}}
